BEHAVIOR post-header

DESCRIPTION
  Writes the fixed HTTP/1.1 POST request header into hdr at offsets 0..55:
  POST / HTTP/1.1 CRLF Host: localhost CRLF Content-Length: 11 CRLF CRLF.
  header_len is 56. The body (11 bytes) is appended after this header by the
  caller.

CONTRACT
  OUTPUT hdr bytes 65536
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH cd8db959

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE hdr 80 1 0       # P
  STORE hdr 79 1 1       # O
  STORE hdr 83 1 2       # S
  STORE hdr 84 1 3       # T
  STORE hdr 32 1 4       # space
  STORE hdr 47 1 5       # /
  STORE hdr 32 1 6       # space
  STORE hdr 72 1 7       # H
  STORE hdr 84 1 8       # T
  STORE hdr 84 1 9       # T
  STORE hdr 80 1 10      # P
  STORE hdr 47 1 11      # /
  STORE hdr 49 1 12      # 1
  STORE hdr 46 1 13      # .
  STORE hdr 49 1 14      # 1
  STORE hdr 13 1 15      # CR
  STORE hdr 10 1 16      # LF
  STORE hdr 72 1 17      # H
  STORE hdr 111 1 18     # o
  STORE hdr 115 1 19     # s
  STORE hdr 116 1 20     # t
  STORE hdr 58 1 21      # :
  STORE hdr 32 1 22      # space
  STORE hdr 108 1 23     # l
  STORE hdr 111 1 24     # o
  STORE hdr 99 1 25      # c
  STORE hdr 97 1 26      # a
  STORE hdr 108 1 27     # l
  STORE hdr 104 1 28     # h
  STORE hdr 111 1 29     # o
  STORE hdr 115 1 30     # s
  STORE hdr 116 1 31     # t
  STORE hdr 13 1 32      # CR
  STORE hdr 10 1 33      # LF
  STORE hdr 67 1 34      # C
  STORE hdr 111 1 35     # o
  STORE hdr 110 1 36     # n
  STORE hdr 116 1 37     # t
  STORE hdr 101 1 38     # e
  STORE hdr 110 1 39     # n
  STORE hdr 116 1 40     # t
  STORE hdr 45 1 41      # -
  STORE hdr 76 1 42      # L
  STORE hdr 101 1 43     # e
  STORE hdr 110 1 44     # n
  STORE hdr 103 1 45     # g
  STORE hdr 116 1 46     # t
  STORE hdr 104 1 47     # h
  STORE hdr 58 1 48      # :
  STORE hdr 32 1 49      # space
  STORE hdr 49 1 50      # 1
  STORE hdr 49 1 51      # 1
  STORE hdr 13 1 52      # CR
  STORE hdr 10 1 53      # LF
  STORE hdr 13 1 54      # CR
  STORE hdr 10 1 55      # LF
END
